text.section:
The commercial driver's license issued by the Department shall be identified as a Virginia commercial driver's license and shall include at least the following:

Full name, a Virginia address, and signature of the licensee;


A photograph of the licensee;


A physical description of the licensee, including sex and height;


The licensee's date of birth and license number that shall be assigned by the Department to the licensee and shall not be the same as the licensee's Social Security number;


A designation of the class and type of commercial motor vehicle or vehicles which the licensee is authorized to drive, together with any restrictions; and


The date of license issuance and expiration.
